      "value": "I keep having this dream, and in it I am some sort of barrel-shaped creature. Around me are vast, cyclopean ruins etched with bizarre carvings. I can hear this constant sound, like a wet slap or suction. And behind it all, a strange sound...TEKELI-LI!"
    },
